  m_text: "<b>LEVEL 4: SPEED TRAPS</b>\r\n\r\n <b>Speed Cameras:</b>\r\nThe city
    is now monitored!\r\n\r\n <b>Heavy Fines:</b>\r\nSpeeding past a camera will
    result in an\r\n<b>immediate fine</b> deducted from your coins. \r\n\r\n <b>Strategy:</b>\r\nDrive
    fast, but <b>BRAKE</b> when approaching\r\na camera zone to save your earnings!"
